fail.noGuild=You are not in a guild, so nobody heard that. Visit Torren in the Hub to join one, or type /e c s to talk to everyone.
fail.noGuildSwitch=You are not in a guild yet. Visit Torren in the Hub to join one, then try again.
fail.guildRole=Your guild role does not allow guild chat.
fail.guildCooldown=Wait two seconds between guild messages.
fail.guildBusy=Guild chat is busy. Try again shortly.
fail.unavailable=Chat is unavailable right now. Try again shortly.
